(text "Protected 2S pack: 8.4 V max, >=10 A discharge capability, factory balancing/protection.\nJ1 adapter power, J2 rear regulated power, J3 rear control, J4 keyboard power, J5 keyboard I2C, J6 CM4/display, J7 audio, J8 battery, J9 NTC.\nPower connector ratings and harness wire size must cover each load. No connector shares raw PD with a 5 V rail." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 71f660aa-bd02-4706-b1ad-58c888d0848b))
